Subject: [PATCH 827/913] plat-stm32mp1: conf: default enable
 CFG_RESET_SYSTEM_ON_PANIC

Enable CFG_RESET_SYSTEM_ON_PANIC by default on stm32mp1x platforms to
execute a system reset after dumping the panic backtrace.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git a8bae91cae30dd9ebf47928a73f1ea8f8ef0e4a2 plat-stm32mp1: conf: default enable CFG_RESET_SYSTEM_ON_PANIC]
Change-Id: Ifc28e70026c501cbc75185a43e3b082be95ed87c
Signed-off-by: Thomas Bourgoin <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/587086
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/conf.mk | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/conf.mk b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/conf.mk
index c021ff6ed..4d119bbf4 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/conf.mk
+++ b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/conf.mk
@@ -208,6 +208,7 @@ $(call force,CFG_INIT_CNTVOFF,y)
 $(call force,CFG_PM_ARM32,y)
 $(call force,CFG_PSCI_ARM32,y)
 $(call force,CFG_REGULATOR_FIXED,y)
